{"status":1,"msg":"Request successful","data":{"id":53,"update_time":1788321773,"content":"<div style=\"font-size: 13px;\">\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Event Time<\/strong><\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. Daily from 12:00 to 22:00, one Treasure Draw every hour.<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. Join based on seat availability. Once full, the draw happens immediately. Limited slots &mdash; first come, first served.<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"> <\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Participation Requirements<\/strong><\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. Conditions follow what is shown on the current session page.<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"6\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. All eligible users can join directly without extra registration.<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"7\" data-line=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"> <\/span><\/div>\n